# StockVault: Student-Friendly, Local-First Build Plan

> **Core Principle**: Everything runs on YOUR machine. Zero cloud costs. Zero paid APIs.  
> We build a genuinely impressive, working product first — cloud deployment is the *last* step, not the first.

---

## 1. What Are We Actually Building?

A **full-stack Portfolio Management Web App** that:
- Connects to your **existing local PostgreSQL** StockVault database
- Has a beautiful, modern dashboard (portfolio, orders, broker stats)
- Has rock-solid authentication (login, registration, JWT)
- Later: an AI chatbot that can answer questions about your portfolio using LangChain

**Everything runs on `localhost`.** No AWS, no cloud databases, no paid APIs until you choose to deploy.

